{"id":"95fd0348476d19cc","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-iteration.md","title":"迭代量词块查询类 FO[t]","display":"df-fo-iteration — 迭代量词块查询类 FO[t]","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-iteration","aliases":["29-df-fo-iteration"],"display":"df-fo-iteration — 迭代量词块查询类 FO[t]","depends_on":["[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 4.24, pp.65–66, DjVu scans 80–81; Definition 10.14, p.163, DjVu scan 178","source_basis":"原书文本层；Definition10.14 的布尔变量约定已查看扫描图178"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-iteration — 迭代量词块查询类 FO[t]"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 4.24, pp.65–66, DjVu scans 80–81; Definition 10.14, p.163, DjVu scan 178"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；Definition10.14 的布尔变量约定已查看扫描图178"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，输入带内建序及端点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\)</span> 及其二种论域语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a>；域变量数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>、额外布尔变量数和量词块均为每个查询固定的常数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 表示输入域大小；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto2^{c n^k}\">\\(n\\mapsto2^{c n^k}\\)</span> 是从正整数到正整数的函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau[Q]\">\\(E_\\tau[Q]\\)</span> 表示像集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau^{-1}[S]\">\\(E_\\tau^{-1}[S]\\)</span> 表示原像。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\)</span> 是以下引入的扩张结构查询类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\\)</span> 是同一有序对输入论域上的查询类记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\{E_\\tau[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\{E_\\tau[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[S]\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\}=\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[S]\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\}=\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c,k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c,k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.24，印刷页65–66、扫描页80–81，先定义固定量词块的重复；Definition 10.14，印刷页163、扫描页178，再显式允许固定数量的额外布尔变量。本条聚合既有的 FO-VAR 接口，没有把随输入增长的量词块族误当成固定块，也不以输入依赖的任意公式族定义 FO[t]。第二式把原书 Theorem 10.13 中的指数族缩写展开为确切的并集；它不是另一个机器类定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 可由扩张的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-约化和序关系恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\">\\(U=(A,L)\\)</span>，故为单射，像集再取原像恰好恢复原查询。两种类分别记录实际接受满足关系的扩张结构和原始有序对输入；不把二者直接混为一个集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]$ 及其二种论域语义见 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]；域变量数 $v$、额外布尔变量数和量词块均为每个查询固定的常数。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_\\tau$、$E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]$ 及 $\\tau^\\uparrow$ 见 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]；$E_\\tau[Q]$ 表示像集，$E_\\tau^{-1}[S]$ 表示原像。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto2^{c n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^\\uparrow","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau[Q]","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau^{-1}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\{E_\\tau[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[S]\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{FO}^\\uparrow[t,\\tau]\\}=\\bigcup_{v\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c,k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FO}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"E_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)","display":false}],"bytes":2500,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]、[[29-df-iter]]、[[29-df-fo-iteration]] — 同时关系迭代、ITER 与 FO[t]"},{"id":"1e73231d304a46ec","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-fo-iteration]] 的有序对查询类；$\\mathcal D$ 在下式构造为标准有序二进制词的带端点扩张，IND 的深度只对该输入论域取界。"},{"id":"fd4992ce7beaa916","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]$ 是 [[29-df-fo-iteration]] 的指数轮数量词块查询类，实际满足关系作用于 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]] 的标准数值扩张 $E_\\tau(U)$。由于保留符号均不在输入词汇，$\\mathcal O_\\tau=\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$；$n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)$。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-iteration]]"}],"outgoing":["7174257cf5cba5d4"]}